{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Brave Village",
    "steam_appid": 3189900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Resource Gathering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/2879a55a12a985a860367a40aee30e70.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to diligently collect various resources, such as wood and ores. Venture deep into dark and dangerous mines, explore every corner of the village and islands, and obtain valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Crop Cultivation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/4cf51b5b76ce724b4b12a5a2d777c373.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase your favorite crop seeds from merchants, carefully plant and tend to them. Once the crops mature, harvest and process them to boost the village's productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Crafting and Processing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/4fa414fbbb85525655da417615f0afac.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the collected resources to craft equipment, food, and medicine needed by the villagers. The village also has many processing buildings that can be accessed by unlocking plots, further enhancing production efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Building and Upgrading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/654bf53637067196548ec04ad1e0b67d.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every villager has a cozy home. Players can upgrade buildings and purchase furniture to create a more comfortable living environment, increasing the villagers' happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/f02ba0f6e73e7db468eacad33291be8e.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins and skeletons are lurking in various areas. Defeat these enemies in battle to gain valuable loot and reclaim treasure chests and lands they have occupied, expanding the village's territory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Resource Gathering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/2879a55a12a985a860367a40aee30e70.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players need to diligently collect various resources, such as wood and ores. Venture deep into dark and dangerous mines, explore every corner of the village and islands, and obtain valuable resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Crop Cultivation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/4cf51b5b76ce724b4b12a5a2d777c373.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase your favorite crop seeds from merchants, carefully plant and tend to them. Once the crops mature, harvest and process them to boost the village's productivity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Crafting and Processing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/4fa414fbbb85525655da417615f0afac.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the collected resources to craft equipment, food, and medicine needed by the villagers. The village also has many processing buildings that can be accessed by unlocking plots, further enhancing production efficiency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Building and Upgrading</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/654bf53637067196548ec04ad1e0b67d.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every villager has a cozy home. Players can upgrade buildings and purchase furniture to create a more comfortable living environment, increasing the villagers' happiness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u00b7Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189900/extras/f02ba0f6e73e7db468eacad33291be8e.avif?t=1731913771\" data-has-big width=800 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goblins and skeletons are lurking in various areas. Defeat these enemies in battle to gain valuable loot and reclaim treasure chests and lands they have occupied, expanding the village's territory.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a casual adventure simulation game where you'll manage a small village and explore dark mines. Upgrade villagers and buildings, craft equipment and food, defeat evil goblins, and reclaim lost lands.",
